{
  "name": "ai-model-world",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "predev": "npm run assets",
    "prebuild": "npm run assets",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start",
    "lint": "eslint",
    "sync": "tsx scripts/sync/index.ts",
    "assets": "tsx scripts/sprites/index.ts && tsx scripts/search-index/index.ts",
    "_comment_sprites": "保留 sprites 这个名字：文档与肌肉记忆都是 `npm run sync && npm run sprites`。它现在把搜索索引也一起重做，免得索引悄悄过期。",
    "sprites": "npm run assets",
    "search-index": "tsx scripts/search-index/index.ts",
    "font": "tsx scripts/fonts/subset.ts",
    "qa:tiers": "tsx scripts/qa/measure-tiers.ts",
    "bilibili": "tsx scripts/bilibili/refresh.ts",
    "toy:build": "NEXT_BASE_PATH=/toy/ai-model-world NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-toy next build && tsx scripts/toy/pack.ts",
    "_comment_toy": "B 站 Toy 包：构建时先统一前缀，pack.ts 再把它换成相对路径并给目录链接补 index.html。原因见 scripts/toy/pack.ts 顶部。产物在 .toy-pkg，用 toy create/update 上传。"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "csv-parse": "^7.0.2",
    "fflate": "^0.8.3",
    "next": "16.3.3",
    "react": "19.2.8",
    "react-dom": "19.2.8",
    "sharp": "^0.35.4"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": "^4",
    "@types/adm-zip": "^0.5.8",
    "@types/node": "^20",
    "@types/react": "^19",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19",
    "eslint": "^9",
    "eslint-config-next": "16.3.3",
    "playwright": "^1.62.1",
    "tailwindcss": "^4",
    "tsx": "^4.23.13",
    "typescript": "^5"
  }
}
